      "purpose": "`openrpc` is a design-first Go implementation of OpenRPC 1.3.x and 1.4.x. It models their shared document shape, preserves arbitrary Draft 7 schemas and extension values, parses untrusted JSON under finite policies, emits canonical JSON, and provides explicit validation, reference resolution, runtime expressions, discovery, composition, compatibility diffing, and JSON-RPC handler integration.",
